{"type":"HOSTEL","name":"Roebuck Bay Backpackers","nameEN":"Roebuck Bay Backpackers","isActive":true,"isNew":false,"description":"🎒 Welcome to The Roey Backpackers – Broome’s Ultimate Stay & Play Spot! 🏝️\n\nJust 2 minutes from Broome Airport, we’re your first stop to adventure! ✈️\nFREE shuttle daily – just call once you’ve landed and grabbed your bags.\n\n📍 Prime location in the heart of town:\nShops, cafes, bus stops, pharmacies, restaurants, galleries, banks & the library – all within walking distance.\n\n🌴 Onsite highlights:\n💦 Tropical pool\n🍳 Communal kitchen\n🚻 Male & female bathrooms\n🧺 Laundry\n🔥 BBQ area\n🍔 Restaurant & bottle shop\n🍻 Sports bar + legendary Oasis Beer Garden\n🎉 Home of the famous Thursday Night Wet T-Shirt Comp (FREE entry)\n\n📶 Free Wi-Fi to share your Broome moments in real time!\n\n🏠 Air-conditioned dorms:\n4, 6 or 10-bed options – male, female & mixed available.\n\n🎉 If it’s happening in Broome, it’s happening at The Roey.\nBook your bed, meet your crew, and let the good times roll! 🏖️🍻","hostelworldSays":null,"hostelSays":null,"location":{"address1":"Carnarvon St","address2":"PO Box 97","city":{"id":898,"name":"Broome","nameEN":"Broome"},"country":{"id":13,"name":"Australia","nameEN":"Australia"},"region":{"id":81,"name":"Western Australia","nameEN":"Western Australia"},"latitude":"-17.9548300","longitude":"122.2435300","distance":{"kilometers":0.22,"miles":0.14}},"maxGuestsPerBooking":8,"depositPercentage":15,"ratings":{"security":47,"location":73,"staff":93,"atmosphere":33,"clean":27,"facilities":27,"value":40,"overall":49,"ratingsCount":51},"groupInformation":{"listingInfo":"","terms":"Planning a big trip? 🎉 We welcome larger group bookings! To ensure you get top-notch service, please email us at reservations@roebuckbayhotel.com.au\n — we’ll take great care of you.","cancellationTerms":"❌ Cancellation Policy:\nWe don’t charge cancellation fees if you cancel more than 24 hours before arrival.\nIf you cancel within 24 hours or don’t